{"Title":"An Act relative to the availability of sunscreen for students ","BillNumber":"S258","DocketNumber":"SD398","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JAC0","Name":"Julian Cyr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAC0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-13T18:26:12.563"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JAC0","Name":"Julian Cyr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAC0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-13T18:26:12.5633333"},{"Id":"PMO","Name":"Patrick M. O'Connor","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMO","ResponseDate":"2023-03-21T09:50:01.8566667"},{"Id":"PJK1","Name":"Patrick Joseph Kearney","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PJK1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-30T13:40:18.46"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S258/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Cyr, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 258) of Julian Cyr for legislation relative to the availability of sunscreen for students.  Education.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Chapter 71 of the Massachusetts General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by adding after section 97 the following section:- \r\n\tSection 98.  Any person, including but not limited to students, parents or school personnel may possess and use a topical sunscreen product without a physician’s note or prescription while on school property or at a school-related event or activity to avoid overexposure to the sun if the product is regulated by the Federal Food and Drug Administration for over-the-counter use. \r\n\tFor the purposes of this Section only, sunscreen is not an over-the-counter medication. Nothing in this section requires school personnel to assist pupils in applying sunscreen. \r\n\tThe school district may encourage school sites to educate pupils on sun safety precautions.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J14","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J14"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}